flowchart LR
  RAW[KArSL .mp4 clips] --> MP[MediaPipe Holistic]
  MP --> NORM[Normalise and concat 258-D]
  NORM --> NPZ[.npz cache]
  NPZ --> SPLIT[Stratified split 60 / 20 / 20]
  SPLIT --> AUG[tf.data + augmentation]
  AUG --> FIT[model.fit on GPU]
  FIT --> CKPT[best.h5]
  FIT --> CKPT2[final.h5]
